 "summary": "A one-row male header on a 2.54 mm grid with straight 0.64 mm square stamped copper-alloy pins, gold plated, in a black PBT body (UL94-V0). Each pin stands 6.0 mm above a 2.54 mm tall body and has a 3.0 mm tail for a Ø1.1 mm hole; it is soldered by wave only. The family runs from 1 to 40 positions; 61300211121 is the 2-position part. Rated 3 A and 250 V AC working, -40 to 125 °C, UL file E323964.",
